# The Unfinished Waltz (jeuno 96) accepted (a GM) at Prog 1 (a GM), a level 75 Dancer by Grauberg [S]'s qm1, The
# Essence of Dance not held. A GM sets the quest's local var hippoEvent to 3 (`localvar Quest[3][96]hippoEvent 3`: the
# quest's own scripts set it to 1 and 2 only): qm1 takes the else arm, ATTEND_TO_MORE_PRESSING (not 12, a Dancer's
# hippoEvent 0; not the spawn of hippoEvent 1; not 13, hippoEvent 2).
lists GraubergS/qm1/onTrigger
char zone=GraubergS pos=329.9,-47.8,93.2 job=DNC lvl=75
quest Jeuno.LakesideMinuet completed
quest Jeuno.TheUnfinishedWaltz accepted
charvar Quest[3][96]Prog 1
login
localvar Quest[3][96]hippoEvent 3       # GM: a value no script sets
trigger qm1                             # Prog 1, hippoEvent 3: ATTEND_TO_MORE_PRESSING
